- * Win8: 5.1
- * Win8.1: 6.0
- * Win10: 6.2
+ * Win8/WS2012: 5.1
+ * Win8.1/WS2012R2: 6.0 (also for HvLite paravisor in Azure)
+ * Win10/WS2016: 6.2
